{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>May He bless you</b> — the meaning is: this blessing shall come to you from the Glory who dwells in Zion. And the meaning of \"the house adjacent in Zion\" is the House of HaShem." "And the meaning of <b>and see the good of Jerusalem</b> — when he goes up for the three pilgrim festivals."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 128, :notes {0 "Resolved הכבוד (\"the Glory\") as a divine epithet rather than a personal name; left it capitalized as the text reads."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:41:23.872568733Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}